## Contract

**skill:** pagination  
**description:** Page navigation component for list/table views — prev/next buttons, numbered page buttons, and page info display.  
**slot-inject:** page-numbers (for external page-number injection)

### Inputs
| Name | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `current` | number | 1 | Current active page |
| `total` | number | 1 | Total number of pages |

### Outputs
| Name | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `onChange(page)` | Callback fired when user selects a page |

---

## Dependencies

- `button-primary` (blue active state via `.active`)
- `button-danger` (not directly used, reserved)

---

## Slots

| Slot Name | Selector | Description |
|-----------|----------|-------------|
| `page-numbers` | `#page-numbers` | Inject custom page number buttons |

---

## Boundaries

- `current` is clamped to `[1, total]`  
- Prev button disabled when `current === 1`  
- Next button disabled when `current === total`  
- All page buttons hidden when `total === 1`  
- `total` must be ≥ 1 (enforced by min prop validation in React)  
- Page numbers render every page when `total ≤ 7`; ellipsis truncation out of scope  

---

## Examples

```html
<!-- Basic usage -->
<div class="pagination" id="pagination">
  <button class="page-btn page-prev" onclick="goPage(prevPage)" disabled>‹ 上一頁</button>
  <div class="page-numbers" id="page-numbers">
    <button class="page-num active" onclick="goPage(1)">1</button>
    <button class="page-num" onclick="goPage(2)">2</button>
    <button class="page-num" onclick="goPage(3)">3</button>
  </div>
  <button class="page-btn page-next" onclick="goPage(nextPage)">下一頁 ›</button>
  <span class="page-info" id="page-info">第 1 頁，共 5 頁</span>
</div>

<!-- With slot injection -->
<template id="page-numbers-tpl">
  <button class="page-num" onclick="goPage(1)">1</button>
  <button class="page-num" onclick="goPage(2)">2</button>
</template>
```

```react
// React component usage
<Pagination current={3} total={10} onChange={page => console.log(page)} />
```

---

[html]
<div class="pagination" id="pagination">
  <button class="page-btn page-prev" onclick="goPage(prevPage)" disabled>‹ 上一頁</button>
  <div class="page-numbers" id="page-numbers">
    <button class="page-num active" onclick="goPage(1)">1</button>
    <button class="page-num" onclick="goPage(2)">2</button>
    <button class="page-num" onclick="goPage(3)">3</button>
  </div>
  <button class="page-btn page-next" onclick="goPage(nextPage)">下一頁 ›</button>
  <span class="page-info" id="page-info">第 1 頁，共 5 頁</span>
</div>

[react]
const Pagination = ({ current = 1, total = 1, onChange }) => {
  const prevPage = Math.max(1, current - 1);
  const nextPage = Math.min(total, current + 1);
  const pages = Array.from({ length: total }, (_, i) => i + 1);
  return (
    <div className="pagination">
      <button className="page-btn page-prev" onClick={() => onChange(prevPage)} disabled={current === 1}>‹ 上一頁</button>
      <div className="page-numbers">
        {pages.map(p => (
          <button key={p} className={"page-num" + (p === current ? " active" : "")} onClick={() => onChange(p)}>{p}</button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <button className="page-btn page-next" onClick={() => onChange(nextPage)} disabled={current === total}>下一頁 ›</button>
      <span className="page-info">第 {current} 頁，共 {total} 頁</span>
    </div>
  );
};

[style]
.pagination { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.page-numbers { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
.page-btn {
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.page-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #f3f4f6; }
.page-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
.page-num {
  width: 36px; height: 36px;
  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.page-num:hover { background: #f3f4f6; }
.page-num.active { background: #3b82f6; color: #fff; border-color: #3b82f6; }
.page-info { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-left: 8px; }
